B.ael=new A.jr("To function reliably as a QR code generator and scanner utility, QR Code Studio may request standard OS permissions:\n\u2022 Camera (android.permission.CAMERA / NSCameraUsageDescription): Used strictly to scan QR codes in real time through the in-app camera viewfinder and to control the camera torch/flashlight during scanning. Camera frames are analyzed locally in memory and are never recorded, stored, or transmitted.\n\u2022 Photo Library / Media Storage (WRITE_EXTERNAL_STORAGE on Android 9 and below, system photo picker / gallery access on Android 10+ and iOS): Used only when You explicitly tap Save to Gallery to save a generated 1024\xd71024 PNG QR image to Your Device, or when You tap Upload Image to decode a QR code from an image You select.",null)
B.aem=new A.k6('This Privacy Policy describes Our policies and procedures on the collection, use, and disclosure of Your information when You use the YT Downloader mobile and web application (the "Application" or "Service") and tells You about Your privacy rights and how the law protects You.\n\nYT Downloader is an on-device media utility application developed and published by Sivaprasad NK. By using the Application, You agree to the practices described in this Privacy Policy.',null)
B.aen=new A.k6("\u2022 No Ads or Tracking SDKs: The Application contains no third-party advertising SDKs and no behavioral analytics or user-tracking SDKs.\n\u2022 Application Updates: On Android, the Application uses Google Play In-App Updates and queries public GitHub Releases to check for newer versions on launch or when requested in Settings.\n\u2022 Platform Diagnostics: When installed via Google Play, standard platform services (such as Google Play Services) may automatically collect basic, anonymized diagnostic and crash logs solely to help Us fix bugs and improve app stability.",null)
B.aeo=new A.k5("If You have any questions about this Privacy Policy, You can contact Us:\n\u2022 Email: sivaprasadnk123@gmail.com\n\u2022 Website: https://sivaprasadnk.dev/\n\u2022 Privacy Policy URL: https://sivaprasadnk.dev/chronocraft/privacy-policy",null)
B.aep=new A.jr("When You scan a QR code containing a web URL and tap Open URL, the link opens in Your Device's default browser at Your direction. We advise You to review the URL and Privacy Policy of any third-party website You visit.",null)
B.aeq=new A.jr("We do not sell, trade, rent, or share Your personal data with third parties or advertisers. The Application contains no third-party advertising SDKs and no user-tracking SDKs. Any QR images You explicitly save to Your Device gallery remain under Your full control and can be deleted at any time from Your gallery or by uninstalling QR Code Studio.",null)
B.aes=new A.jr(u.i,null)
B.aer=new A.k6(u.i,null)
B.aet=new A.k5('This Privacy Policy describes Our policies and procedures on the collection, use, and disclosure of Your information when You use the ChronoCraft mobile application (the "Application" or "Service") and tells You about Your privacy rights and how the law protects You.\n\nChronoCraft is a clock, alarm, world clock, timer, and stopwatch utility application developed and published by Sivaprasad NK. By using the Application, You agree to the practices described in this Privacy Policy.',null)
B.aeu=new A.jr('This Privacy Policy describes Our policies and procedures on the collection, use, and disclosure of Your information when You use the QR Code Studio mobile and web application (the "Application" or "Service") and tells You about Your privacy rights and how the law protects You.\n\nQR Code Studio is a QR code generator, customizer, and scanner utility application developed and published by Sivaprasad NK. By using the Application, You agree to the practices described in this Privacy Policy.',null)
B.aev=new A.k6("\u2022 Application: Refers to YT Downloader (dev.sivaprasadnk.yt_downloader_mobile), the video, audio, thumbnail, and subtitle extractor software program provided by the Developer.\n\u2022 Developer / We / Us / Our: Refers to Sivaprasad NK, Kerala, India.\n\u2022 Device: Means any device that can access the Service such as a smartphone, tablet, or computer.\n\u2022 Personal Data: Any information that relates to an identified or identifiable individual.",null)
B.aew=new A.k6("To function reliably as a media utility, YT Downloader requests only essential permissions:\n\u2022 Internet (android.permission.INTERNET): Used directly by Your Device to fetch public media metadata, download user-requested streams, and check for application updates via Google Play In-App Updates or GitHub Releases.\n\u2022 Photos / Media / Storage (WRITE_EXTERNAL_STORAGE on Android 9 and below, MediaStore on Android 10+): Used solely when You explicitly save downloaded MP4 videos, JPEG cover art, audio tracks, or subtitles to Your Device's Photos/Gallery album (YT Downloader) and Download/YT Downloader directory.",null)
B.aez=new A.k5(u.v,null)
B.aey=new A.jr(u.v,null)
B.aex=new A.k6(u.v,null)
B.aeA=new A.jr("If You have any questions about this Privacy Policy, You can contact Us:\n\u2022 Email: sivaprasadnk123@gmail.com\n\u2022 Website: https://sivaprasadnk.dev/qrcode\n\u2022 Privacy Policy URL: https://sivaprasadnk.dev/qrcode/privacy-policy",null)
B.aeB=new A.k6("We do not sell, trade, rent, or share Your personal data with third parties or advertisers. All downloaded files and local download history are stored strictly on Your Device and can be deleted at any time from the in-app Library tab, Your Device gallery/file manager, or by uninstalling YT Downloader.",null)
B.aeC=new A.jr("\u2022 No Personal Data Collected: QR Code Studio does not require You to create an account and does not collect, store, sell, or share any personally identifiable information (such as Your name, phone number, email address, contacts, or GPS location) on external servers.\n\u2022 100% On-Device QR Generation & Scanning: All QR codes You generate (including text, URLs, custom patterns, corner eye styles, and color palettes) and all QR codes You scan (via live camera or uploaded images) are processed 100% locally on Your Device. None of the text, links, or images You enter or scan are ever uploaded or transmitted to any external server.",null)
B.aeD=new A.k6("If You have any questions about this Privacy Policy, You can contact Us:\n\u2022 Developer: Sivaprasad NK\n\u2022 Email: sivaprasadnk123@gmail.com\n\u2022 Website: https://sivaprasadnk.dev/yt-downloader\n\u2022 Privacy Policy URL: https://sivaprasadnk.dev/yt-downloader/privacy-policy",null)
B.aeE=new A.jr("\u2022 Application: Refers to QR Code Studio (dev.sivaprasadnk.qr_code_studio_mobile), the QR code generator and scanner software program provided by the Developer.\n\u2022 Developer / We / Us / Our: Refers to Sivaprasad NK, Kerala, India.\n\u2022 Device: Means any device that can access the Service such as a smartphone, tablet, or computer.\n\u2022 Personal Data: Any information that relates to an identified or identifiable individual.",null)
B.aeF=new A.k5("We do not sell, trade, rent, or share Your personal data with third parties or advertisers. Because Your alarms, timers, and preferences are stored locally on Your Device, You can delete all data at any time by deleting items inside the ChronoCraft app or clearing the app storage / uninstalling ChronoCraft from Your Device.",null)
B.aeG=new A.k5("To function reliably as a clock, alarm, and timer utility, ChronoCraft may request standard OS permissions:\n\u2022 Exact Alarms (SCHEDULE_EXACT_ALARM / USE_EXACT_ALARM): Used strictly to trigger Your scheduled alarms and countdown timers at the exact time You specify.\n\u2022 Notifications & Full-Screen Intent (POST_NOTIFICATIONS / USE_FULL_SCREEN_INTENT): Used to display active timer progress and alarm alerts when the screen is locked.\n\u2022 Foreground Service & Wake Lock (FOREGROUND_SERVICE / WAKE_LOCK): Used to keep active timers, stopwatches, and ringing alarms running reliably.\n\u2022 Receive Boot Completed (RECEIVE_BOOT_COMPLETED): Used to automatically reschedule enabled alarms after Your Device restarts.\n\u2022 Vibration & Audio Settings (VIBRATE): Used to play alarm tones and vibration patterns.",null)
B.aeI=new A.k5(u.P,null)
B.aeH=new A.jr(u.P,null)
B.aeJ=new A.k6("\u2022 No Personal Data Collected: YT Downloader does not require You to create an account and does not collect, store, sell, or share any personally identifiable information (such as Your name, phone number, email address, contacts, browsing history, or GPS location) on developer-operated servers.\n\u2022 100% Local Processing: All URL parsing, stream extraction, audio/video muxing, thumbnail export, closed-caption (.vtt) generation, and file management occur 100% locally on Your Device.",null)
B.aeK=new A.k5("Our Service is a general-audience timekeeping utility and does not knowingly collect personally identifiable information from anyone, including children under the age of 13.",null)
B.aeL=new A.k5("\u2022 Application: Refers to ChronoCraft, the clock, alarm, timer, and stopwatch software program provided by the Developer.\n\u2022 Developer / We / Us / Our: Refers to Sivaprasad NK, Kerala, India.\n\u2022 Device: Means any device that can access the Service such as a smartphone, tablet, or wearable device.\n\u2022 Personal Data: Any information that relates to an identified or identifiable individual.",null)
B.aeM=new A.k5("\u2022 No Personal Data Collected: ChronoCraft does not require You to create an account and does not collect, store, sell, or share any personally identifiable information (such as Your name, phone number, email address, contacts, or GPS location) on external servers.\n\u2022 Locally Stored App Data: All clock configurations, alarms, alarm labels, timers, stopwatch laps, selected world clock time zones, and theme/display preferences are stored locally on Your Device. This data never leaves Your Device.",null)
